<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-ROMANIA'S GALATI OUT OF UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIA'S GALATI OUT OF UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Otelul Galati of Romania beat 4-2 (halftime 2-0) HIT Gorica of Slovenia in their qualifying round second leg of UEFA Cup on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Otelul Galati - Vali Stefan 20, 27, Adrian State 63, Ioan Viorel 75</p>
<p>HIT Gorica - Nenad Proteja 88, Mirsad Demirovici 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000</p>
<p>HIT Gorica qualifies on away rule after 4-4 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
